  "body": "Step into the next chapter of your life with this stunning, architecturally designed townhouse – the perfect fusion of style, comfort, and location in one of Auckland’s most coveted neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nGround Floor: Space to Live, Room to Grow\r\n\r\n- Private ensuite bedroom—ideal for guests, teenagers, or extended family, offering true flexibility for your lifestyle\r\n- Dedicated laundry for everyday convenience\r\n- Secure internal-access garage—effortless arrivals and departures, rain or shine\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: Experience Entertaining at Its Finest\r\n\r\n- Sun-drenched, open-plan living and dining area that flows to a generous deck—just right for relaxing mornings, vibrant brunches, or unforgettable evenings with friends\r\n- Designer kitchen with premium gas cooking—ignite your culinary passion in a space made for creativity\r\n- Thoughtful extras, including a guest powder room and integrated air conditioning, ensure total comfort for you and your guests\r\n\r\nUpper Level: Your Private Sanctuary\r\n\r\n- Spacious master suite with its own air conditioning—an oasis of serenity, no matter the season\r\n- Two additional bedrooms and a beautifully appointed bathroom—perfect for family, home office, or creative pursuits\r\n\r\nInvest with Confidence\r\n\r\n- 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for lasting peace of mind\r\n- Freehold title—no body corporate fees, giving you total freedom and security\r\n\r\nUnmatched Quality – Inside and Out\r\n\r\n- Luxurious fully tiled bathrooms\r\n- Energy-efficient LED lighting and comprehensive insulation for year-round comfort\r\n- Double-glazed windows keep your home quiet, cozy, and bathed in natural light\r\n\r\nPrime Location, Effortless Living\r\n\r\nImagine evening strolls by the sparkling waters of Lake Pupuke, with everything you need just minutes away—North Shore Hospital, top local schools, and easy motorway access. Life here is designed to be seamless, secure, and truly special.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are rare. Secure your future—contact us today and make this exceptional townhouse yours!",
